{"a":[4,4],"h":"<p>4.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"70\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 69.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 30.0 30.0 30.0 39.0 39.0 46.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 46.6 53.3\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> -Rabbın sıfatıdır, ya'ni bu beytin o Rabbı ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 150.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 28.4 36.7 36.7 57.7 57.7 68.2 68.2 84.0 84.0 93.0 93.0 101.2 110.2 117.0 117.0 127.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"101.2 110.2 127.4 134.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onları, o Kureyşi büyük bir açlıktan doyurdu- cû'un ve havfın tenvinleri tefhıym ve tehvil içindir. Bu açlık ve doyum hakkında üç kavil vardır. Birisi: İbrahim aleyhisselâmın «</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"428\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 427.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 24.8 24.8 33.0 48.8 63.8 70.6 70.6 77.3 84.8 100.6 111.0 111.0 126.8 126.8 133.6 142.6 144.8 144.8 151.6 151.6 158.3 174.0 174.0 184.6 191.3 191.3 203.3 210.0 225.8 232.6 240.8 240.8 247.6 247.6 261.8 269.3 276.0 282.8 291.0 291.0 300.0 306.8 306.8 313.6 313.6 320.3 320.3 336.8 343.6 350.3 350.3 357.0 374.3 374.3 374.3 381.0 381.0 388.6 401.3 401.3 410.3 410.3 417.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.0 48.8 70.6 100.6 133.6 158.3 184.6 210.0 225.8 247.6 343.6 350.